# Vue 和 Element UI 模式

## Element UI 实现
本应用程序使用 Element UI 2.12.0 版本，采用标准化方法：

- 全局大小配置可通过 `$globalSearchConfig.size` 获取，默认值为 'small'
- Element UI 在 [src/main.js](mdc:src/main.js) 中导入和配置

## 常见组件模式

### 搜索表单
搜索表单通常遵循以下模式：
```vue
<div class="new-header-wrapper">
  <div class="new-header-max-width">
    <div class="new-search-wrapper">
      <!-- 组织选择器 -->
      <div class="new-search-box">
        <div class="new-search-label">组织</div>
        <el-cascader
          v-model="orgValue"
          :options="orgOptions"
          :props="cascaderConfig"
          :size="$globalSearchConfig.size"
          @change="handleChange"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- 日期选择器 -->
      <div class="new-search-box">
        <div class="new-search-label">时间</div>
        <el-date-picker
          v-model="dateValue"
          type="month"
          :size="$globalSearchConfig.size"
          @change="handleChange"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- 稽核日期 -->
      <div class="new-search-box">
        <div class="new-search-label">稽核日期</div>
        <el-radio-group v-model="auditTimeTab" @input="inputTime" size="small">
          <el-radio-button :label="1">昨日</el-radio-button>
          <el-radio-button :label="2">今日</el-radio-button>
          <el-radio-button :label="3">
            自定义
            <el-date-picker
              @focus="auditFocusTimer"
              @blur="auditTimeTab = auditCustomizeTime.length ? '3' : ''"
              @change="auditChangeTimer"
              v-model="auditCustomizeTime"
              value-format="yyyy-MM-dd"
              type="daterange"
              range-separator="~"
            />
          </el-radio-button>
        </el-radio-group>
        <span style="display: inline-block;margin-left: 10px;">
          <span>{{ auditStartTime }}</span>
          <span v-if="auditTimeTab == '3' && auditEndTime" >~</span>
          <span v-if="auditTimeTab == '3'" >{{ auditEndTime }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- 自定义时间选择器 -->
      <div class="new-search-box" v-if="timeType === 'custom'">
        <div class="new-search-label"></div>
        <el-date-picker
          v-model="customTime"
          type="date"
          size="medium"
          placeholder="请选择时间"
          value-format="yyyy-MM-dd"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- 搜索按钮 -->
      <div class="new-search-but">
        <el-button type="primary" :size="$globalSearchConfig.size" @click="search">查询</el-button>
        <el-button :size="$globalSearchConfig.size" @click="reset">重置</el-button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```
